From 1557eab6daaa7f8a82b1227a72fbedef1b56b3bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AMB-1 FM6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 21:11:18 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] 1.3.98: the reel's dry/wet, the space before or after it, a
 deck page, the reel on the screen

- Tape's LEVEL is DRY/WET: Dry the garden alone, 50 both full, Wet the reel alone (the garden recorded unheard)
- a Deck page (SEQ again): FX, the space before the reel (recorded with it, the reel dry) or after it (the reel
  recorded dry, played through the space); WOW (and flutter), DRIVE (saturating onto tape), TONE (the reel's highs)
- on the reel's pages the screen shows the reel: a cassette whose spools wind and turn at SPEED, the reel as a strip
  with its splices, the one playing, the cursor, the genes, the record head; seconds recorded and splices
- project format 11 (format 10 carried over); MIDI CC 50..61

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
